WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.202
-House Democrats called
on the vice president

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:04.370
to remove President Trump

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.838
through the
Twenty-fifth Amendment

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.073
as they prepared to vote

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.775
on a resolution
to impeach the president.

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.609
Meanwhile, Trump emerged
for the first time

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:11.945
since his Twitter ban

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:14.347
and refused to take
any responsibility at all

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.215
for inciting a violent riot
at the Capitol.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:18.484
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:22.421
♪♪

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.090
The House is preparing
to impeach Trump

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.824
for inciting an insurrection,
which would make him

00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:27.627
the only president ever
to be impeached twice,

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.095
who'll also be
the only president

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.164
who lost the popular vote
the first time;

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.333
in reelection, the second time,
in addition to being impeached.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.902
A record number
of Americans went

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.603
to the polls
to boot him from office

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:40.406
and his job approval is now
down to 33%.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:43.009
His name will be etched
in the Congressional Record

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.277
and in history books forever

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.412
as a seditionist
and aspiring tyrant

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.981
and the worst, most dangerous
president we've ever had.

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.017
He could very well
be permanently disqualified

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:52.251
from holding office
in the future,

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:53.853
arrested,
and tried for sedition.

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.188
He's been banned from so many
social media platforms,

00:00:56.188 --> 00:00:58.124
he's going to have to start
hiding his hateful rhetoric

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.492
in Yelp! reviews.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.695
His longtime bank is refusing
to do business with him

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:05.498
and he could even be held liable
for civil damages,

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.933
in addition to being prosecuted.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.001
Oh, and his wife
won't hold his hand.

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:10.403
Well, one of them won't.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.105
And, yet, knowing Trump,
none of that

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.574
will matter as much to him
as this --

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.177
-New England Patriots
head coach Bill Belichick

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.045 line:0%
declining the civilian honor

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.047 line:0%
the Presidential Medal
of Freedom,

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.149 line:0%
with President Trump set
to award it later this week.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:26.219 line:0%
Instead, Belichick put out
a statement saying, in part,

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.621
"[T]he tragic events
of last week occurred

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.656
and the decision has been made

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:32.391
not to move forward
with the award."

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:34.493
-The fallout of the attack
on the Capitol

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.362
continues for President Trump,

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.231 line:0%
who has now
lost his relationship

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.566 line:0%
with the Professional
Golfers' Association.

00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:43.869 line:0%
The PGA announced it was moving
its 2022 championship

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:46.705 line:0%
away from Trump National
Golf Club in Bedminster.

00:01:46.705 --> 00:01:49.109 line:0%
The PGA says holding
a championship there

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.711 line:0%
would be "detrimental"
to its brand.

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:52.778
-Well, well, well.

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.480
Once again, big golf tries

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.015
to silence conservatives.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.518
First, it's the media;
then, it's big tech;

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:02.121
now, it's famous Antifa leftist
Bill Belichick and the PGA

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.223
tearing down our country.

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.523
Don't Belichick and the PGA know

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:06.559
that what we need right now
is healing and unity?

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.862
How dare they hurt
Mr. Trump's feelings

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:11.063
and the feelings
of 74 million Americans

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:12.732
by taking away his precious
golf tournament

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:13.933
from his private resort.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.368
Don't they know
how much those hardworking,

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.637
real Americans love
to sit home on a Sunday

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.738
and watch
the PGA Polyester Fashion Show

00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:21.708
by a bunch of trust fund
semi-athletes

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.043
named Cameron
and Bryson and Brooks?

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.411
Taking golf away from Trump

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.379
is like taking away
Freddy Krueger's claws.

00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:30.149
Without them, he's just a dude
with a messed-up face

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:31.817
who looks bad in hats.

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:33.686
Seriously, though,
you know you're toxic

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:37.723
when a guy who looks like this
thinks you're bad for his brand.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:38.924
How does he get to games,

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:40.393
tornado?

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.161 line:0%
So that's where things are
for Trump.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:43.529 line:0%
Then, today,
he emerged in public

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:46.232 line:0%
for the first time since losing
his ability to tweet

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.234
and, as the nation
continues to process

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.902
the deadly insurrection
he incited

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:52.672
and the ongoing threats
from right-wing terrorists,

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:55.007
the president refused to take
any responsibility

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:56.141
for his role in the riot,

00:02:56.141 --> 00:02:58.644
choosing, instead,
to lash out at Democrats.

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.946
-We want no violence,
never violence.

00:03:00.946 --> 00:03:02.748
We want absolutely no violence.

00:03:02.748 --> 00:03:06.853 line:0%
And, on the impeachment,
it's really a continuation

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:10.023 line:0%
of the greatest witch hunt
in the history of politics.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.324 line:0%
It's ridiculous.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.192 line:0%
It's absolutely ridiculous.

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:17.130 line:0%
This impeachment is causing
tremendous anger

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.398 line:0%
and you're doing it
and it's really

00:03:19.398 --> 00:03:22.101 line:0%
a terrible thing
that they're doing.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:25.571 line:0%
For Nancy Pelosi
and Chuck Schumer

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:27.673 line:0%
to continue on this path,

00:03:27.673 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
I think it's causing tremendous
danger to our country

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.978 line:0%
and it's causing
tremendous anger.

00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:34.446 line:0%
I want no violence.

00:03:34.446 --> 00:03:35.681
-[ As Trump ]
I incited violence,

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:37.183
even though I want no violence,

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.518
but, if you impeach me
for inciting violence,

00:03:39.518 --> 00:03:40.519
there will be violence.

00:03:40.519 --> 00:03:42.288
No violence.
But also,

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:43.389
there will be violence.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.623
We don't want people
to be angry,

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:46.959
but also, they should be angry,
and dangerous.

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:49.995
Anger and danger,
those are the two key words.

00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:51.564
No violence.
But anger

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:52.898
and danger and violence.

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:54.433
But hold the violence.

00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:56.636
I want no violence.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.004
Seriously, he could've
just gone with,

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:00.106
"Do what I say
and nobody gets hurt."

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:02.474
Seriously, is he trying to get
impeached a third time?

00:04:02.474 --> 00:04:04.443
Is he going
for an Iron Man streak

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:06.078
where he commits
an impeachable offense

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.647
every day
until he leaves office?

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.615
Does he think this is Quiznos --

00:04:09.615 --> 00:04:12.885
if he gets impeached ten times,
the eleventh is on the house?

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.254
Trump then spoke again
to reporters

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.989
before he got
on his flight to Texas

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:19.258
and, this time, he insisted
his speech to the violent mob,

00:04:19.258 --> 00:04:21.260
whipping them into a frenzy
and inciting them

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.963
to ransack the Capitol,
was actually totally fine.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:30.035
-So, if you read my speech --

00:04:30.035 --> 00:04:33.439
and many people have done it
and I've seen it both

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:37.510
in the papers and in the media,
on television --

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:40.913
it's been analyzed and people
thought that what I said

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.582
was totally appropriate.

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:45.385
But they've analyzed my speech
and my words

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:48.420
and my final paragraph,
my final sentence,

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.989
and everybody, to the "T,"

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:51.590
thought it was
totally appropriate.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.726
-No, no, no one thought that.

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:55.227
What do you mean,
they analyzed it?

00:04:55.227 --> 00:04:56.996
I mean, I heard the speech

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:59.798
and it wasn't exactly
James Joyce's "Ulysses."

00:04:59.798 --> 00:05:02.868
If you heard it,
you analyzed it.

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:04.803
Trump is actually doubling down
in defending himself

00:05:04.803 --> 00:05:07.473
after inciting an insurrection
against the Capitol.

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:10.108
Just to be clear, in case
it needs any more clarity,

00:05:10.108 --> 00:05:12.211
Trump didn't just incite
the crowd,

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:13.546
by telling them
to march to the Capitol

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:14.980
and fight and show strength.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.817
He encouraged and enjoyed

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.551
the scenes of violence
and sedition.

00:05:19.551 --> 00:05:21.553
In fact, we know,
from new reporting,

00:05:21.553 --> 00:05:23.623
that even as lawmakers
and people inside the building

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:26.058
were pleading with Trump
to send help, he refused.

00:05:26.058 --> 00:05:28.861
In fact, his aides couldn't even
tear him away from the TV.

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:31.530
-A behind-the-scenes report
on the president's activities

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:34.667
during the riot
that he helped set off.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:37.703 line:0%
Multiple sources tell
The Washington Post

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:40.472 line:0%
Trump was busy watching
the violence on TV

00:05:40.472 --> 00:05:42.108 line:0%
