of Trump's actions

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:56.388 line:0%
during those six hours
of mob rule

00:05:56.388 --> 00:05:59.692 line:0%
and found Trump to be
a man who didn't care,

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:03.462 line:0%
even as Republican lawmakers
begged him to speak out.

00:06:03.462 --> 00:06:05.765 line:0%
-There's new
Washington Post reporting.

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:07.833 line:0%
"'He was hard to reach,
and you know why?

00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:11.938 line:0%
Because it was live TV,'
said one close Trump adviser"...

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.249
-My God, he's worse than Nero.

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:25.384
At least Nero played
his own fiddle.

00:06:25.384 --> 00:06:26.786
Trump would just call one in.

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:27.853
[ As Trump ]
Can we get a fiddler in here?

00:06:27.853 --> 00:06:29.889
It's just more fun
with the fiddle.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:31.457 line:0%
It's honestly hard to articulate

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:34.860 line:0%
just how sadistic
and sociopathic this is.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.729 line:0%
People were calling
and begging him to help

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:38.097
as violent,
right-wing terrorists

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:39.465
were ransacking the Capitol,

00:06:39.465 --> 00:06:41.200
