during the riot.

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:56.515
He wanted his supporters
to disrupt the counting

00:06:56.515 --> 00:06:58.150
of the electoral votes
through violence

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.419
and, even when his aides managed
to get through to him,

00:07:00.419 --> 00:07:01.486
Trump refused to help

00:07:01.486 --> 00:07:03.822
because he was enjoying it
so much.

00:07:03.822 --> 00:07:06.793
-He was engaging with aides
as this was all going on.

00:07:06.793 --> 00:07:08.161
They were interrupting,
telling him

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:09.262
