overrun by his supporters.

00:07:13.799 --> 00:07:15.634 line:0%
He was well aware of it.
He was watching it.

00:07:15.634 --> 00:07:18.504 line:0%
He was pleased because it was
people fighting on his behalf.

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:20.239 line:0%
He was pleased
