why this happened.

00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:30.015 line:0%
He knew what was happening.
He was back and forth

00:07:30.015 --> 00:07:32.385 line:0%
from the small dining room
where he watches television

00:07:32.385 --> 00:07:34.821 line:0%
off the Oval Office
to the Resolute Desk.

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:37.122 line:0%
He just didn't want
to do anything.

00:07:37.122 --> 00:07:39.191
-First of all, "He just didn't
want to do anything"

00:07:39.191 --> 00:07:41.393
