The sign never specified

00:09:41.213 --> 00:09:42.581
when and where you could eat it!

00:09:42.581 --> 00:09:44.016
And, when you skip out
on the check

00:09:44.016 --> 00:09:46.218
and tell the waiter you have
a legal right to this shrimp,

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:47.552
based on the Constitution,

00:09:47.552 --> 00:09:49.688
[ Bellowing ]
a document you have never read,

00:09:49.688 --> 00:09:51.790
he chases you down
and takes your license plate

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.792
and calls 911 and tells them
you're a shrimp thief

00:09:53.792 --> 00:09:55.227
and the cops come to your house

00:09:55.227 --> 00:09:57.029
and confiscate the shrimp
from your fridge

00:09:57.029 --> 00:09:59.331
and embarrass you in front
of your stepson and his friends

00:09:59.331 --> 00:10:01.466
while they play
"Tony Hawk's Pro Skater" on Xbox

00:10:01.466 --> 00:10:03.269
and laugh at you
and call you a shrimp dweeb.

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:05.137
And you say,
"Stop calling me that, Tyler,"

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:08.240
and then, he and his friends,
they push you down the stairs.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.708
Imagine that.

00:10:09.708 --> 00:10:10.976
[ Laughter ]

00:10:10.976 --> 00:10:12.711
My God!

00:10:12.711 --> 00:10:16.248
Are these people whiny,
hysterical lunatics

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:18.651
who never miss an opportunity
to make themselves the victims,

00:10:18.651 --> 00:10:21.620
even after a deadly insurrection
at the nation's Capitol.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.488
Like Congressman Matt Gates
and Jim Jordan,

00:10:23.488 --> 00:10:25.758
two seditionists
who aided and abetted

00:10:25.758 --> 00:10:28.660
the president's deranged lie
that led to this insurrection

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.329
and who voted to side
with the mob

00:10:30.329 --> 00:10:31.631
and overturn the election,

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:33.265
even after the Capitol
was ransacked.

00:10:33.265 --> 00:10:35.634
Gates and Jordan went
on Fox News last night,

00:10:35.634 --> 00:10:38.103
not to complain about the
erosion of our democracy,

00:10:38.103 --> 00:10:40.072
but to complain about Twitter.

00:10:40.072 --> 00:10:43.008 line:8%
-If they can cancel a president
with a second impeachment

00:10:43.008 --> 00:10:44.110 line:8%
and what they've done
to the president

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.644 line:7%
with the social media platforms,

00:10:45.644 --> 00:10:47.212 line:8%
if they can cancel
a president,

00:10:47.212 --> 00:10:49.915 line:8%
imagine what they can do
to the 75 million people

00:10:49.915 --> 00:10:52.485 line:8%
who supported President Trump
in this election.

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:53.885 line:7%
That's what's so dangerous.

00:10:53.885 --> 00:10:56.321 line:8%
-These people want to be able
to control what we see

00:10:56.321 --> 00:11:00.192 line:8%
and how we behave and,
to constrain speech in this way,

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:02.127 line:8%
I think, is very damaging
to the country.

00:11:02.127 --> 00:11:04.596
-These two look like a frat guy
and a serial killer.

00:11:04.596 --> 00:11:07.666
You guys know my friends,
Axe Body Spray and Ax.

00:11:07.666 --> 00:11:09.434
These fools literally tried
to cancel the votes

00:11:09.434 --> 00:11:11.103
of 81 million Americans,
but, now, they lose

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:13.739
some Twitter followers
after a violent insurrection

00:11:13.739 --> 00:11:15.740
and they're whining
about cancel culture,

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.142
pretending to care about unity.

00:11:17.142 --> 00:11:20.612
Like Florida Senator Rick Scott,
who insisted that Joe Biden,

00:11:20.612 --> 00:11:22.448
rather than
the current president

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:24.282
or any of the Republicans
supporting him,

00:11:24.282 --> 00:11:27.252
should be solely responsible
for seeking unity.

00:11:27.252 --> 00:11:29.055
-If you go talk
to American families --

00:11:29.055 --> 00:11:31.056
I talk to people
of Florida every day --

00:11:31.056 --> 00:11:33.492 line:0%
What do they want?
They want a positive message.

00:11:33.492 --> 00:11:35.660 line:0%
Joe Biden should be excited
about the fact

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.697 line:0%
that he's going to become
the president next week

00:11:37.697 --> 00:11:39.531 line:0%
and should have
a positive message,

00:11:39.531 --> 00:11:41.967 line:0%
but he is a hypocrite.

00:11:41.967 --> 00:11:43.502 line:0%
He says, "Oh, I want unity,

00:11:43.502 --> 00:11:47.239 line:0%
but, I want to call
my opponents Nazis.

00:11:47.239 --> 00:11:49.075 line:0%
You know, I want unity, but,

00:11:49.075 --> 00:11:50.676 line:0%
if you want to go forward
with impeachment,

00:11:50.676 --> 00:11:51.810 line:0%
you know, go ahead."

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.946 line:0%
I mean, this is not
what Americans want.

00:11:54.946 --> 00:11:56.848
-Dude, go back
to your [bleep] milk bath.

00:11:56.848 --> 00:11:59.985
What about the 81 million
Americans who voted for him?

00:11:59.985 --> 00:12:01.720
Do you think what they wanted
was for their votes

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.423
to be thrown out by a handful
of Republican congressmen,

00:12:04.423 --> 00:12:05.524
something you tried to do,

00:12:05.524 --> 00:12:07.759
even after the mob
stormed the Capitol?

00:12:07.759 --> 00:12:09.628
I'm so sick of these ass[bleep]
calling for unity

00:12:09.628 --> 00:12:11.063
after doing arguably

00:12:11.063 --> 00:12:13.365
the most divisive thing
you can do in a democracy,

00:12:13.365 --> 00:12:17.303
and that's overturn an election,
doing it after a riot.

00:12:17.303 --> 00:12:21.040
And why is it that only Biden is
the one who has to seek unity?

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.541
Why don't you do
something unifying,

00:12:22.541 --> 00:12:24.910
like resign or apologize

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.613
or start every sentence
about tone with,

00:12:27.613 --> 00:12:29.781
"No one was more divisive
than President Trump

00:12:29.781 --> 00:12:31.750
and I see that now and I feel
terrible for supporting him"?

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.851
Is that so hard?

00:12:32.851 --> 00:12:34.486
Or how about Fox host
Brian Kilmeade,

00:12:34.486 --> 00:12:36.421
who had this to say
about how divisive

00:12:36.421 --> 00:12:38.891
impeaching an insurrectionist
president would be?

00:12:38.891 --> 00:12:40.125 line:8%
-By the way, you know
what the theme

00:12:40.125 --> 00:12:41.660 line:14%
to Joe Biden's inauguration is,

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.362 line:14%
and maybe his first four years?

00:12:43.362 --> 00:12:45.163 line:14%
"America United."

00:12:45.163 --> 00:12:46.899 line:8%
Do you know one thing
that can guarantee

00:12:46.899 --> 00:12:48.701 line:8%
America won't be united?
-An impeachment?

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:50.102 line:14%
-Having an impeachment trial

00:12:50.102 --> 00:12:52.271 line:8%
on a president that's going
to be at Mar-a-Lago.

00:12:52.271 --> 00:12:54.139
-I agree.
He shouldn't be at Mar-a-Lago.

00:12:54.139 --> 00:12:55.607
When it happens,
he should be in jail

00:12:55.607 --> 00:12:57.742
or, at the very least,
stuck in a sand trap,

00:12:57.742 --> 00:12:59.911
as the only golfer
in a canceled tournament.

00:12:59.911 --> 00:13:01.747
[ As Trump ]
Some help me crawl
out of this thing.

00:13:01.747 --> 00:13:04.783
Tiger! Rory?

00:13:04.783 --> 00:13:06.218
Phil!

00:13:06.218 --> 00:13:07.652
Dorf! Oh!

00:13:07.652 --> 00:13:09.955
[ Laughter ]
Oh, I knew you wouldn't
forget me, Dorf.

00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:11.123
Give me your hand.
Oh!

00:13:11.123 --> 00:13:12.157
No, no, stop!

00:13:12.157 --> 00:13:14.126
Don't throw more sand
on me, Dorf.

00:13:14.126 --> 00:13:15.861
Oh, no, not you, too, Dorf!

00:13:15.861 --> 00:13:18.930
Oh, no!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.299
I love "Dorf on Golf,"

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:21.533
but you know
what's really funny?

00:13:21.533 --> 00:13:22.801
"Dorf on Insurrection."

00:13:22.801 --> 00:13:26.938
[ Laughter ]

00:13:26.938 --> 00:13:28.273
Also, you know
what else guarantees

00:13:28.273 --> 00:13:29.441
America won't be united?

00:13:29.441 --> 00:13:32.211
Inciting a riot
to overturn an election.

00:13:32.211 --> 00:13:34.747
How about you guys look inward
and take some responsibility

00:13:34.747 --> 00:13:37.917
and express maybe a scintilla
of regret for your role in this?

00:13:37.917 --> 00:13:40.185
Maybe that would help
foster unity.

00:13:40.185 --> 00:13:42.754
I mean, I don't think
we're ever going to be friends,

00:13:42.754 --> 00:13:44.523
but maybe we could be roommates

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:46.758
who don't like each other,
but cohabitate,

00:13:46.758 --> 00:13:50.128
thanks to passive-aggressively
writing our names on food.

00:13:50.128 --> 00:13:51.597
These guys are like
cheating husbands,

00:13:51.597 --> 00:13:53.665
who get sued for divorce
and then say, "What?!

00:13:53.665 --> 00:13:54.866
You want half my stuff?!

00:13:54.866 --> 00:13:56.702
This should be a time
for unity and healing.

00:13:56.702 --> 00:13:58.970
It's not my fault your
sister's hotter than you."

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:02.307
The president gleefully incited
a deadly, insurrectionist riot

00:14:02.307 --> 00:14:05.277
to overturn democracy,
refused to do anything about it,

00:14:05.277 --> 00:14:07.279
then insisted that his speech
was appropriate,

00:14:07.279 --> 00:14:08.914
and, instead
of taking even an ounce

00:14:08.914 --> 00:14:10.281
of responsibility for that,

00:14:10.281 --> 00:14:11.817
Republicans are making
themselves the victims,

00:14:11.817 --> 00:14:12.818
as they always do.

00:14:12.818 --> 00:14:13.885
The only way to stop this is

00:14:13.885 --> 00:14:15.787
to demand accountability,

00:14:15.787 --> 00:14:18.290
remove Trump from office,
and try him for sedition.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.791
It won't be too hard
to find him.

00:14:19.791 --> 00:14:21.093
Just put out a bulletin for...

00:14:21.093 --> 00:14:23.362
-A president that's going
to be at Mar-a-Lago.

00:14:23.362 --> 00:14:24.796
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

